---
---

<section id="top" class="hero no-rule">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">FeathersJS v5 · Model Context Protocol</p>
      <h1>Bolt an MCP server<br />onto your <em>Feathers</em> app.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        feathers-mcp plugs a full Model Context Protocol server into an existing FeathersJS
        app as a regular service. No parallel auth stack, no side-channel session store —
        every tool call is a real, authenticated Feathers call with a real <code class="inline">params.user</code>.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs/">Read the docs</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/nesgarbo/feathers-mcp">GitHub</a>
      </div>

      <div class="pill-row">
        <span class="pill"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--teal-light)"></span>Koa &amp; Express</span>
        <span class="pill"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--violet-light)"></span>Authenticated tool calls</span>
        <span class="pill"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--gold)"></span>One McpServer per session</span>
        <span class="pill"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--ink-dim)"></span>TypeBox schemas</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="mark-tile">
        <img src="/logo-mark.svg" alt="" width="180" height="180" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 56px; }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--teal-light);
  }

  .lede { margin-top: 22px; }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 34px;
  }

  .pill-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .mark-tile {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, var(--bg-card), var(--bg));
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px -30px rgba(69, 39, 166, 0.3);
  }

  .mark-tile img {
    width: 46%;
    height: auto;
    animation: rise 0.7s ease both;
  }

  @keyframes rise {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px) scale(0.97); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-mark { order: -1; max-width: 220px; margin: 0 auto; }
  }
</style>
